Spec: Owner-controlled secure stream acceptance

Purpose:
  Provision only owned test resources and verify independent SDK applications against real Agent authority.

Owns:
  ./OwnerHarness.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/SecureAuthority.sdd
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/SecureIdentity.sdd

Must:
  Keep test authority separate from consumer applications and use explicit versioned grants.
  Stop owned child processes and restrict recursive cleanup to verified artifact children.
  Verify active revocation closes data within five seconds and prevents later opens.
